2. Attribution requirement
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Any website, application or other product that includes all or part of a
Relic UI component must give visible credit to Relic UI, with a link to
https://relic-ui.vercel.app (or the project's current website), in a place
where its users or visitors can find it. A footer, an about or credits page,
or the project's README all qualify.

The credit comment at the top of each component file, and this copyright
notice, must not be removed from the source code.

